    "detailed_description": "We will all be curious about some experiences. But we also hope that everyone will not encounter such experiences. For example, what does a plane crash look like? This game will let curious you have some VR experiences. Hope there will be no more plane crashes in the real world.<br />\r\nIn the game, you will simulate the flight of an airplane and you can control the airplane. After flying for a period of time, the airplane will crash due to a malfunction, and you will also fall to a small island full of zombies due to the crash. In order to survive you need to cut down the zombies and find the treasures on the island.",
